I'll start by exploring the existing dashboards in the `api` and `client` folders to understand what's already built.Let me explore the client structure properly.Let me read the existing dashboard-related components and the api model.I've reviewed the existing dashboards in `api` and `client`. Here's what already exists to build on:

| Existing surface | File | What it gives us |
|---|---|---|
| **Planning / Follow-up dashboard** | `client/src/components/kanban/board/FollowupView.vue` + `api/codx/junior/model/planning.py` | `metrics`, `board_progress`, `attention`, `activity`, paginated `tasks`, attention reasons (`overdue`/`due_today`/`unassigned_high`/`stalled`) |
| **Analytics / AI cost** | `client/src/components/analytics/MetricsDashboard.vue` + `api/codx/junior/api/analytics*.py` | tokens, calls, `total_cxjcoins`, by-model / by-user / by-project, daily series, pricing |
| **Team view** | `client/src/views/TeamView.vue` + `components/team-view/*` | teams, members, roles (profiles re-framed as AI team members) |
| **Kanban / sprints** | `client/src/store/kanban.js`, `store/planning.js` | boards, sprint boards, statuses `todo/doing/onhold/done`, priorities, assignees, due dates, progress |
| **Theme** | `client/src/assets/themes/codx-junior-dark.css` | dark-first, magenta primary `#cc0099`, info/success/warning/error semantics |

None of them is a **cross-project management dashboard** — each is scoped to one project or one concern. That's the gap this mockup fills.

---

## 1. Screen & flow outline

**App: "Team Command Center"** — single file, left rail + mobile bottom nav, hash routes.

| Route | Screen | Must work |
|---|---|---|
| `#/pulse` | **Pulse** (default) | "Needs you now" alert strip (urgency first), 6 KPIs, delivery forecast strip, attention queue, team load, activity feed, AI spend sparkline. Every block drills down. |
| `#/work` | **Work** | All tasks across all projects: project / board / status / priority / assignee filters + search + sort + pagination. Row → detail drawer with edits. |
| `#/blockers` | **Blockers** | Attention queue grouped by reason (blocked / overdue / stalled / unassigned), severity sort, "ask for update", reassign, unblock. |
| `#/delivery` | **Delivery** | Per-board forecast (progress vs target, velocity, ETA, confidence, risk), burndown chart, milestone/sprint table with demo dates. |
| `#/team` | **Team** | Capacity bar, member cards (humans + AI agents) with load %, active / blocked / done, AI cost attributed; overloaded filter; member drawer. |
| `#/cost` | **Cost & AI** | Spend KPIs, budget bar + projection, daily chart with series toggles, breakdowns by project / model / user, cost per delivered task. |
| global | **AI assistant** | Bottom-right panel: suggested questions, mock answers computed from the same data, source chips that navigate. |
| global | **Time filter** | Today / 7d (default) / 30d / 90d — applies to every section, persisted. |

Plus: loading skeletons, empty state, error state (dev menu), toasts, `Esc`-closable overlays, localStorage persistence + "Reset mock".

## 2. Mock API contract

Reuses the real shapes; ➕ = proposed endpoint (does not exist yet, computed by the mock "backend").

| Method | Endpoint | Payload |
|---|---|---|
| GET | `/api/projects` ✅ | `[{id,name,color,code,lead}]` |
| GET | `/api/boards` ✅ | `[{id,name,project_id,type:kanban\|sprint,target_date,demo_date,total,done}]` |
| GET | `/api/teams` ✅ | `[{id,name,members:[...]}]` |
| GET | `/api/planning/dashboard?from&to` ✅ | `{metrics,board_progress,attention:[{task,reason,severity}],activity,priority_counts}` |
| POST | `/api/planning/tasks/query` ✅ | body `{range,project_ids,boards,statuses,priorities,assignees,search,page,page_size,sort}` → `{tasks,total,total_pages,has_next,group_counts}` |
| PATCH | `/api/planning/tasks/{id}` ✅ | `{status?,priority?,due_date?,progress?,assignees?,blocked?}` → `{task,activity_event}` |
| ➕ GET | `/api/planning/forecast?from&to` | `[{board,committed,done,remaining,velocity,eta_date,confidence,risk,status}]` |
| ➕ GET | `/api/planning/burndown?board_id` | `{points:[{date,ideal,actual,remaining}]}` |
| ➕ GET | `/api/planning/team-load?from&to` | `[{id,name,role,type,load_pct,active,blocked,done,cost}]` |
| GET | `/api/analytics/admin/total` ✅ | `TokenUsageMetrics` + `cost_per_delivered_task` |
| GET | `/api/analytics/admin/daily?grouping=day` ✅ | `[{period,input_tokens,output_tokens,total_tokens,calls,total_cxjcoins}]` |
| GET | `/api/analytics/admin/by-project\|by-model\|by-user` ✅ | `{[key]:TokenUsageMetrics}` |
| ➕ GET | `/api/analytics/admin/budget` | `{weekly_budget,spent,remaining,projected,pct,per_project[]}` |
| ➕ POST | `/api/assistant/ask` | `{question,from,to}` → `{answer,sources[]}` |

## 3. The mockup

