Root cause found — the mockup file **was never written**: my previous answer got truncated mid-file, so `mockups/admin-team-dashboard.html` does not exist on disk. Nothing to open ⇒ "not working".

The `sandbox` warning is a **host-side warning** (codx-junior previews files in an iframe with `allow-scripts allow-same-origin`). It is not an error in the mockup, but it does mean the mockup must **not depend on same-origin APIs** (`location.origin`, `localStorage`) or it dies inside that preview. The old code used `new URL(input, location.origin)` — inside a sandboxed iframe the origin is `"null"` and that call **throws**, killing every request. That is fixed below.

